    "answer": {
      "short": "$28\\%$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{white})&=1-P(\\text{not white})\\\\P(\\text{white})&=1-\\frac{20+12+4}{50}\\\\P(\\text{white})&=1-\\frac{36}{50}\\\\P(\\text{white})&=\\frac{14}{50}\\\\P(\\text{white})&=28\\%\\end{align*}$$",
